  "body": "Driving a USB device from a worker allows processing to be moved off of the main event loop. Moving device access to a Shared Worker also allows multiple tabs of the same application to coordinate access to a single device as unique ownership of an interface is enforced by both the WebUSB API and underlying operating systems.\r\n\r\nUnlike defining WebUSB in Service Workers there are likely no additional security and privacy considerations here.",
